OL,3,GNEWSAWoman settles Department of
OL,4,AEducation sexual harassment case for
OL,5,A#25k
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who witnessed a senior male
OL,8,Fcolleague viewing provocative images of
OL,9,Fwomen on his computer at the Department
OL,10,Fof Education has settled her sexual
OL,11,Fharassment case for #25,000.
OL,13,FThe woman said she felt like she was
OL,14,Fbeing "reprimanded" when HR told her to
OL,15,Fwork from home or another office if she
OL,16,Fdid not want to continue working
OL,17,Falongside the man.
OL,19,FHer case was supported by the Equality
OL,20,FCommission for Northern Ireland and was
OL,21,Fsettled without admission of liability.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
